Initial DocScanner app: camera capture, perspective crop, PDF export

Flutter app targeting Android and Windows from one codebase - photo
capture or file import, manual corner crop with perspective correction,
color/grayscale/B&W filters, multi-page PDF export, and a local document
library. Includes a GitHub Actions workflow that builds the APK and
Windows EXE automatically.

